cff-version: 1.2.0
title: rs-metadata
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata in this file."
type: software
abstract: >-
  An LUMC profile of CodeMeta 3.1 for research software metadata, with a
  validator that checks codemeta.json against the profile and keeps it
  consistent with every other metadata file in the repository, including
  CITATION.cff, .zenodo.json, packaging manifests and the repository's own
  GitHub metadata. Ships as a command-line tool and as a reusable GitHub
  Action.
authors:
  - family-names: Steeghs-Turchina
    given-names: Mariia
    affiliation: Leiden University Medical Center
version: "1.0.0"
repository-code: https://github.com/LUMC-DCC/rs-metadata
url: https://lumc-dcc.github.io/rs-metadata/
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - codemeta
  - citation file format
  - research software
  - metadata
  - FAIR
  - validation
